{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02859","headline":"登叶县故城谒沈诸梁庙 · 李百药","name":"登叶县故城谒沈诸梁庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"总辔临秋原，登城望寒日。\n烟霞共掩映，林野俱萧瑟。\n楚塞郁不穷，吴山高渐出。\n客行殊未已，沐澡期终吉。\n椒桂奠芳樽，风云下虚室。\n馆宇肃而静，神心康且逸。\n伊我非真龙，勿惊疲朽质。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}